# Working in this repo

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before you edit.
- Follow [How a change happens](../../AGENTS.md#how-a-change-happens). Use the issue and pull request templates in `.github/`.
- One issue, one branch, one pull request. Stay inside the current issue.
- Issue titles start with one emoji code, such as 🛠️ or 📄. Pull request titles are a plain sentence.
- Roxana reviews and merges.
- Do not change app behaviour unless the issue asks for that change.
- Do not put secrets in a file, a log, or a pull request.
